  <item>
    <title>006｜老友记：成为“接头暗号”的心头好饭好咖，我们的压箱底满是回味</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a6d50a247d51713c510a87</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a6d50a247d51713c510a87</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Feb 2025 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家新年好！在寒假即将结束之前终于做好了这期内容，休息了太久，那就用血脉唤醒血脉。这期与其说是“指南”，不如说“在苍蝇馆子和米其林之间，选择相信朋友的胃”，一起聊了聊吃吃喝喝，是一期非常惬意的聊天（疯狂发散）。这期可以很清晰的看到上海打工人的血脉——我们花了5分钟聊播客，15分钟聊吃饭，以及30分钟聊咖啡馆，你的DNA动了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当我最终听完整期内容，手表跳出HRV监测“轻松舒适，连呼吸都带着花香”。到此发布时间，新的一年真的开始了，我的最后一天休息日，早安朋友们！2025也要一起尽兴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：雯子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> 百小时+用户的播客推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>--干饭环节--</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> 浦东反复打卡、反复好评的性价比《海鲜面馆》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftqqo9_QcY4OnhtrEXxoX7M1tP5Z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> 浦西有沙发的居酒屋《high yaki》，环境总有奇妙磁场</span></p><span></span><p><span>--咖啡狂喜--</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">18:14</a> 上海猜不出配料表的《村口大树》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a> 浦东梅园公园边角料+超丝滑酶化奶咖《mouth feel》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk7nwx1Myv9ERRan4kPze9r5F8s-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> 如果不是迫不得已肯定不会买98一杯的美式——店名没记住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 济州岛氛围小店“坐在自家农场喝橘子汽水”《Cafe Tangerine Flower Attic》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FslCDX7f864dO7Jo88Kd77_9Puvf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 上海罚站特调咖啡接头暗号《OPS》，下一季还来“浪费时间”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhhBcwj7gt0KdrcxlSNsmOm-xDKr.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2157">35:57</a> 北京幸福回忆之暖冬里的《铁手咖啡》，好天气里唠闲嗑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2377">39:37</a> 上海晨跑后就应该钻进一家咖啡店，告诉自己“周末启动我倍儿棒”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2472">41:12</a> 非工作日的奶茶不算功能性饮料，毕竟它是《茶颜悦色》啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2647">44:07</a> 从简到繁再到简的咖啡节，我仍然学不会“专业地喝一杯咖啡”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2861">47:41</a> 东京黑衬衫帅哥咖啡师都在《glitch》，无门槛的好喝无差评</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqgkG39VVCdnj71LBRS8NM7l-9nW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2928">48:48</a> 对韩国“氛围咖啡店”和“不间断摄入美式”说all in</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiVoQHmltbRI7UhWZuPLE8Pi2-38.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《今日休业中》王铮亮</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67710edc5fdbc382fd75389e/lmroxwddZCfiz4i2HhJnNaVsOxQB.m4a" length="53515191" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgIfkCBMsP-n_qzBW-BBJyJcCCFV.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>6</itunes:episode>
