  <item>
    <title>002｜老友记：互联网人转型起号，独立教师搞钱指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677cdaa6cda04ef4c1fc1c33</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677cdaa6cda04ef4c1fc1c33</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 Jan 2025 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期出差的《人间尽兴指南》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在苏州，和Lucy一起呆了几天，又是好久没见了！一直拖到了现在才见面，岁末年初。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lucy现在是一位独立老师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在此之前，她经历了互联网大厂的工作、小厂的过度，后来边读书边工作，也体验了教培老师、全日制老师，今年一直朝着独立老师的方向在努力，路越走越宽、越来越具体。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她说，当老师是一种本就可以伴生出情绪价值的工作；互联网工作是最有价值的一段经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> &nbsp;“我现在的生活状态是上二休五”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 这份工作怎么来的？在做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">04:54</a> 独立老师的专业化道路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a> 搞钱的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 给家长提供情绪价值，然后给孩子提供的价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 那我就想问了，你的情绪价值从哪里获得呢？孩子们都是天使！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 互联网职场潜移默化的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 做老师有班味儿吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1438">23:58</a> 互联网思维指导下的独立老师如何搞钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 做二休五的自由和局限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a> 越来越养老的松散生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> 稳定现金流也没那么难搞！继续拓展自己的边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">39:53</a> 全日制老师的“噩梦”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3018">50:18</a> 全日制老师需要强大的心脏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3173">52:53</a> 播客给你的兴奋点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3377">56:17</a> 做一个独立老师有啥建议？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3694">1:01:34</a> “和孩子们一起看到美好未来，与有荣焉”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4107">1:08:27</a> “和你聊天让我对未来起了力气”</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《my soul》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmJZB02sF_cQ2m460tflDlMv6iCz.m4a" length="67712358" type="audio/mp4"/>
