  <item>
    <title>001｜朋友、念头和尽兴，那些你很冒险的梦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677969d41e823e72d3394c11</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677969d41e823e72d3394c11</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jan 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第一期是关于朋友、关于念头、关于做梦的聊天。尽兴只是顺带的附加体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但尽兴却是我们所有的源动力和星星之火，期待朋友们听完尽兴可以兴奋的说“我又成为了生机勃勃的年轻人”，也期待朋友们可以就此开启与我同行的尽兴之旅。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 感谢！被播客陪伴了很久很久</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">03:11</a> 我和嘻嘻这两三个月在干嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a> 周末活动上的我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> 嘻嘻的冠军团队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="588">09:48</a> 在绝境之前做点舒适区外的尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 第一次提尽兴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> 嘻嘻：反复被JJ的演唱会“击中”，一年看4场！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 沫言：尽兴起源于陆家嘴咖啡节（“泥地插秧节”）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1312">21:52</a> 重申金句“如果你没误过机，那你浪费了太多时间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">23:07</a> 天呐！我爱“不扫兴”的朋友、父母…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1804">30:04</a> 不刻意才会更尽兴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1941">32:21</a> 能力范围内别凑合你的念头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2079">34:39</a> 这个播客“人间尽兴指南”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2103">35:03</a> 我更想要尽兴，而不是稳定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2251">37:31</a> i人变e之后，人生照片易如反掌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a> 照片之外的精彩瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2549">42:29</a> 喜报！i人出片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 上海的魅力“印象”，我爱上海！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2836">47:16</a> 隆重推荐mouthfeel</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2861">47:41</a> 主动充实生活，高能量的成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> 占据年龄一半的友谊，奇妙的链接</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>0713《像你这样的朋友》新春版！</span></p><span></span><p><span>林俊杰《那些你很冒险的梦》</span></p>]]></description>
